<SiteLayout title="For venues" description="For cafés, bars and activity spaces that want to make meeting people feel a little more considered." eyebrow="Good places. Better reasons to meet." heading="Be part of the first hello." intro="For cafés, bars and activity spaces that want to make meeting people feel a little more considered.">
<section class="editorial-split"><h2>A place to meet.<br />A plan to share.</h2><div><p>Sometimes the hardest part is turning “we should meet” into an actual plan. Swoovr’s venue concept brings optional, clearly described experiences into that moment: a coffee, an activity or a relaxed place to talk.</p><p>We’re exploring Adelaide partnerships with venues that value a welcoming environment, clear expectations and practical communication with guests.</p><p>People will still be free to make their own plans. A paid experience isn’t a requirement for a connection.</p></div></section><section class="steps"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h2>Tell us about your space.</h2><p>Where are you, what kind of experience could you offer, and what makes the setting comfortable for a first meeting? Accessibility, quieter times and transport options are useful details.</p></div></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h2>Define the experience together.</h2><p>The intended model includes clear inclusions, availability and booking conditions, with an auditable voucher and redemption process. Pricing, fees, cancellations and commercial responsibilities need agreement before any offer goes live.</p></div></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><div><h2>Keep the welcome human.</h2><p>A venue needs enough information to honour a booking, not someone’s dating preferences or private conversations. We want a discreet, practical experience for staff and guests alike.</p></div></article></section><section class="callout"><p class="eyebrow">Adelaide venue conversations</p><h2>Have a place in mind?</h2><p>Tell us about your venue, a possible experience and the best person to speak with. This is an expression of interest; there are no listing fees or partnership commitments through this form.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/?topic=venue">Talk to us about your venue</a></section>
</SiteLayout>
